    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem abc.variants.lt_constant_mul (ε : ℝ) (hε : 0 < ε) : ∃ K,\n    ∀ (a b c : ℕ), 0 < a → 0 < b → 0 < c → ({a, b, c} : Set ℕ).Pairwise Nat.Coprime → a + b = c →\n    c < K * (radical <| a * b * c : ℝ)^(1 + ε)",
